# Absent-safe witness recipe — S2 separation hardening.
# Issues an inti command (which requires IntiGame.dll) followed by an
# engine-neutral authoring command. With the DLL absent, the inti command
# must fail with a visible "inti unavailable" status while the engine stays
# alive and still executes the authoring command. With the DLL present, the
# plugin loads and the photo-run starts normally.
inti photo-run
author start absent-safe-witness
